                                                "text": "Complains of a bad taste in his mouth ; there is some sore throat and difficulty of deglutition ; appetite very bad ; not very thirsty[…]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fd55c918-0b06-473f-a534-516068aae023",
                                                "sense_id": "8f51a2ab-5d2f-3372-80c4-7bdf31e98285",
                                                "text": "Some sore throat is a common symptom also in erysipelas of the scalp."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "089d8312-61c9-469d-8b3f-ef2fcc8c7762",
                                                "sense_id": "8f51a2ab-5d2f-3372-80c4-7bdf31e98285",
                                                "text": "I have a bit of sore throat."
                                            }
